            "block_content": "This Agreement made and entered into this 17th day of December, 1962 by and between ACME MARKETS, INC. of Forty Fort, Pennsylvania, hereinafter referred to as the Company, and LOCAL No. 72, AMALGAMATED FOOD EMPLOYEES UNION, chartered by AMALGAMATED MEAT CUTTERS AND BUTCHER WORKMEN OF NORTH AMERICA, AFL-CIO, hereinafter referred to as the Union.",
